+From c7bc1e5a25a460363366128579fe2b0cd9f0a588 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: RepLog Dev <dev@replog.local>
+Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 05:27:12 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Sync: add 516-exercise library + 27 templates +
+ personalized onboarding onto building main
+
+Applies the exercise-library and template/onboarding improvements on top of
+the APK-building main (79debc5), without reverting any of the build-stabilising
+edits made there:
+- exercises.json: 32 -> 516 (all equipment types, full muscle/pattern/difficulty tags)
+- DataSeeder: idempotent template seeding; inserts missing bundled exercises on
+  app update (existing installs get the full library); install all / generated program
+- domain/templates: BuiltInTemplates (27) + ProgramGenerator (offline rules engine)
+- Personalised onboarding (goal/level/equipment/days/units -> generated program)
+- Workout screen: 'Add Built-in Templates' button
+- PreferencesManager: training-profile + coach cache keys
+
+Preserved from main: CoachContracts, gradlew_fixed, Android.yml CI, SettingsViewModel
+restPresets fix, RestTimerService ongoing= fix, TrainingDnaRepository.kt filename,
+and the removed unit tests (kept removed for CI). ActiveWorkoutScreen keeps your
+import order + @OptIn; only the one-line template button was added.
